          "710210103": {
            "id": "710210103",
            "speakerId": 20127,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "Forget it. I've been shut indoors ever since joining the Sumeru Academia. I haven't done any outdoor activities since.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710210104"
            ]
          },
          "710210104": {
            "id": "710210104",
            "speakerId": 20127,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "You can't really use your wind glider at the Academia either, so I've probably returned all my gliding instructor's teachings back to them...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710210105"
            ]
          },
          "710210105": {
            "id": "710210105",
            "speakerId": 20127,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "If you asked me to glide over there, I'd probably fall into the water halfway."
          },
          "710210107": {
            "id": "710210107",
            "speakerId": 20127,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "I thought so too, and I did remember that you could charter one at Dornman Port, but that's way too far away.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710210108"
            ]
          },
          "710210108": {
            "id": "710210108",
            "speakerId": 20127,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "Who knows how long a round trip will take, either...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710210109"
            ]
          },
          "710210109": {
            "id": "710210109",
            "speakerId": 20127,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "But I couldn't possibly construct my own boat. I mean, I learned nothing about that in the Academia..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
